{
  "schema": "oslian.functional-group-map.v1",
  "basis": "Demo-approved clinical-function navigation, keyed on the 11 functional modules of the pinned WholeBody-JEPA checkpoint (module_variables copied from the checkpoint's variable_module_ids). primary/secondary/related splits and organ links are a navigation convention for this dashboard, not a canonical schema and never a diagnostic statement.",
  "groups": [
